  "feedback_interpretation": "Recent feedback supports local condition-response experiments, explicit loading-solvent tests, structural boundary labels and compact controls. This batch emphasizes independently chosen candidate rows across donor, ester, aldehyde, ketone, nitrile, sulfur, fused hydrocarbon and halogenated environments, with several meaningful ratio and loading contrasts.",
